WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.170
Rent is up.

2
00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:02.250
Food is up.

3
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.650
Transport too.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.700
But your salary? It’s barely keeping up.

5
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.750
That’s why earning in foreign currency can make a difference when your bills are in naira.

6
00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.020
International remote work opens that possibility.

7
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:19.740
But finding roles you can actually apply for from Nigeria takes time.

8
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:24.850
OpenRemote Match helps you find roles that fit your profile and are open to Nigeria,

9
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.880
with practical help to apply.

10
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.000
See how it works.

